{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0704",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“瞧，我们俩不是挺般配吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look, don't the two of us make a pretty good match?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那个人薄薄的皮肤，透明得连血管都看得见，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That person's thin skin was so translucent that even the blood vessels could be seen,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "小小的下巴和嘴唇……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "with a small chin and lips...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "古怪地说起了挖苦的话，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he began speaking sarcastically in a strange way,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“我们的关系，就是在交换商品的样本吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Our relationship is just an exchange of product samples, isn't it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……不中意的话，什么时候都可以退回……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...If you don't like it, you can return it anytime...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不拆封，透过塑料袋，仔细端详，就能估价……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Without opening the package, you can look it over carefully through the plastic bag and judge its value...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "怎么啦？……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What's the matter?...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "真能够相信你吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Can I really trust you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00704",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "没留神买下了，以后会让人叫苦不迭吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If I buy it without paying attention, will it make me bitterly regret it later?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
